WEBVTT

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:49.990
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:52.800
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:55.630
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:59.900
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:02.870
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:05.740
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:07.650
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:11.550
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:13.150
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:18.960
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:21.060
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:24.830
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:28.830
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:31.400
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:34.570
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:37.440
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:43.720
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:44.620
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:47.320
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:50.120
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:53.020
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:54.590
<i>Together we are</i>

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:57.660
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:09.310
We finally have someone with immeasurable 
power behind us... Jyaku-King!

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:12.790
The symbol of the power of 
darkness has come back to life.

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:15.270
We have nothing to fear now.

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:19.110
Light and dark... the two powers 
fighting against each other will clash.

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:20.950
It's getting interesting.

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:32.930
"CHEER POLLUN UP! SPECIAL CARNIVAL"

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.130
Popo...

00:02:57.130 --> 00:02:58.580
Popo! Popo!

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:09.800
The power of the seven stones 
were entrusted to Pollun,

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:12.660
and it gave us a new power.

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:23.670
From now on, together with Mepple and Mipple,

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.440
we'll have to protect Pollun, too.

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:30.080
And we have to get the seven 
stones and Stone Keeper back.

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:32.920
But where is the Hopish?

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:36.250
Is Stone Keeper safe?

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:38.250
Popo!

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:47.570
Popo... popo... popo...!

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:47.570
Nagisa! Are you up?

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:48.880
I'm coming in.

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:50.320
Nagisa!

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:51.690
Don't worry...

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:53.270
I'm up!

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:54.700
Hurry, and get ready.

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:58.160
Popo... popo...

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:01.020
Sis! Where's the triangle I lent you?

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:03.760
Where is it? Where is it?

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.400
I found it!

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:12.890
You...!

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:14.160
I'm taking this back.

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:18.070
How dare you come in and trash 
my room while I'm sleeping!

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:21.580
I'll get you! Cobra twist!

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:24.470
I give up... I give up!

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:29.490
If you ever do this again, 
it'll be even worse!

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:34.730
That brat!

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:35.910
Popo!

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:37.260
Good morning, Pollun.

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:38.790
I hate this popo!

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:39.230
What?

00:04:39.430 --> 00:04:41.790
I don't want to sneak around anymore popo!

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:44.190
I want to go back to the Field of Light popo.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.670
Pollun...

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:51.450
I'm late! Breakfast!

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:54.080
Nagisa! Mepple!

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:55.640
Mepple...!

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:57.440
Mep...

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:03.810
Don't come into my room without permission.

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:07.130
I couldn't help it... you wouldn't get up.

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.610
Don't you think you did something wrong?

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:11.920
Don't come into my room without permission...

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:14.330
After all, I'm a lady.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:17.120
What lady would choke you with a Cobra Twist.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.370
What was that?

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:19.890
That's enough!

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:22.360
If you don't hurry, you'll be late.

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:24.350
Sis is acting strange, isn't she?

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:26.040
I'm not wrong, am I?

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.990
Never mind! Hurry, and eat your breakfast!

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.970
Popo...

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:33.840
Are you still grumbling?

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:34.910
Eat your breakfast!

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:37.540
Popo!

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.050
Popo...!

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:53.290
Did you call, Master Pollun?

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:55.970
Omp! Let's play together popo!

00:05:56.350 --> 00:06:01.340
Master Pollun... my duty 
is to prepare your meals.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:02.610
Popo!

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:04.580
Shikalp!

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:06.040
Let's play popo!

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:09.300
You mustn't do that, Master Pollun...

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:13.020
Neither Omp nor I can play with you.

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:17.410
Did you call me?

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:20.310
If you're sick, just leave it to me.

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:22.010
I'm not sick popo.

00:06:22.390 --> 00:06:24.410
Let's play together popo!

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:26.870
That's enough Master Pollun!

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:28.180
Let's play tag popo!

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:29.560
You're "It," Shikalp popo!

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.510
Let's play popo!

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.090
What are you saying?

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:35.540
Come back here!

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:38.550
Over here...

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:40.830
Why are you running away?

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:42.140
Come back here.

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:44.120
Popo... popo...

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:46.470
Come back here! I said... Come back here!

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:51.290
I'm late!

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.510
Come back!

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:01.180
Hey! What do you think you're doing?

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.190
Be quiet!

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:10.880
I finally got them to play with me popo.

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:13.050
You're supposed to be quiet.

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:15.100
It's boring popo!

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:18.160
I want to go back to the Field of Light popo!

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:19.930
I'm going home popo!

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:22.380
I'm going home popo!

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:21.440
Be quiet...

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:24.360
All right already... Just stop!

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:28.550
It seems like Nagisa is talking 
to herself more and more...

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:34.390
I see... I live apart from my parents, too,

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:36.300
so I know how Pollun feels.

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:39.140
He's away from the friends 
he used to play with,

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:41.570
and he has to hide, and live here.

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:43.540
I can't blame him for feeling lonely.

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:47.240
But there's nothing that we can do...

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:52.820
He can't return to the Field of 
Light without the Prism Hopish mipo.

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:57.150
Without that, there won't be a rainbow 
to get to the Field of Light mepo.

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:59.630
In other words, even if 
Pollun says he's going home,

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:01.320
he can't right now, can he?

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:04.780
That's right! We have to 
hurry, and save Stone Keeper,

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:08.420
and get the seven stones and 
the Prism Hopish back mepo!

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:11.510
Why don't we ask Pollun?

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:11.910
Ask him what?

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:16.370
It seems that Pollun has the 
power to foresee the future.

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:19.330
So maybe he can see where the Hopish is.

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.520
That might work mipo.

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:24.860
We might learn something 
about Stone Keeper mipo.

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:28.110
We're late for school! We'd better hurry!

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:35.020
What are you looking at?

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:36.760
What are you looking at?

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:38.910
You be quiet.

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:40.220
You be quiet.

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:42.810
Why did the stones lose their power?

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:43.490
I don't know.

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:44.340
I don't know.

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:46.330
Where's the power of the stones?

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:48.440
I told you... I don't know.

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:50.640
I told you... I don't know.

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:52.620
Where did you hide it?

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:55.940
Where did you hide it?

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:01.840
Where did you hide it!

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:04.760
You scared me.

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:06.310
You scared me.

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.500
Shut up!

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:10.050
Hurry, and tell us!

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:11.880
Hurry, and tell us!

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:14.240
Tell us! Tell us!

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:15.600
Be quiet!

00:09:18.180 --> 00:09:19.520
What?

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:21.460
I told you if you get rid of me,

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:24.980
able to use the power of the stones.

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:27.930
Never mind... I already 
have an idea where it is.

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:29.410
I'll make sure I get it this time.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:30.570
No...

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:34.750
This time... I'll go.

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:37.700
What did you just say?

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:38.630
Hey! Wait!

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:40.810
Hey! Wait! Wait! Wait!

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:58.350
I'm home, Pollun.

00:09:58.350 --> 00:10:00.610
It looks like he's taking a nap, doesn't it?

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.910
I had a good sleep popo.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:09.740
You have the power to foresee 
the future, don't you?

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:10.670
Popo...?

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:12.990
Don't feel anything...?

00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:15.330
For example, maybe something 
about Stone Keeper...

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:17.450
Or the Hopish.

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:20.830
In order to go back to the 
Field of Light someday,

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:23.330
we have to save Stone Keeper and the Hopish.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.810
I want to go back to the Field of Light popo.

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:27.600
That's why you have to 
try as hard as you can.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:31.070
A talking bird popo.

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:32.020
A talking...

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:32.660
...bird?

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:34.050
A talking bird.

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:35.730
A mynah bird?

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:36.610
A parrot?

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:37.640
A cockatoo?

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:41.510
But we have no idea what that is!

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:43.320
A talking bird popo!

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:45.940
Help me.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.960
If all goes well, I'll reward you.

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:51.790
We need to get out of this bird cage.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.060
Look over there. There's your reward.

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:54.760
Reward!

00:10:55.160 --> 00:10:58.110
The apples are your reward. 
They're waiting for you.

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:00.340
Apple! Apple! Apple!

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:01.790
No one's here...

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:04.100
Break the bird cage while they're gone.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:07.600
Break it! Break it! Break it!

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:09.610
That's it.

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:10.910
Hurry! Hurry!

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:14.950
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:18.970
It's not my fault.

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:21.290
It's your fault!

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:23.150
That hurts popo!

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:24.980
What does that mean?

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:27.640
If you really have the power to foresee,

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:30.550
as a test, tell me what 
we're having for dinner.

00:11:30.550 --> 00:11:31.970
Hamburger popo.

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:34.730
He's right! That's what 
Mom said this morning.

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:35.630
Popo.

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:37.260
Never mind that...

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:39.710
Don't you feel anything about Stone Keeper?

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:43.810
Do you know what I'm having 
in my bento lunch tomorrow?

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:45.780
Fried chicken popo!

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:46.850
That's amazing!

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:49.250
This isn't the time for that, Nagisa!

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.020
How about tomorrow night's dinner?

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:52.540
Barbecue beef popo!

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:56.580
All right! We're having 
barbecue beef tomorrow night!

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:57.580
Nagisa!

00:11:57.790 --> 00:11:59.380
I'm sorry.

00:12:00.970 --> 00:12:03.300
I can go home to the Field of Light popo!

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:04.600
Popo! Popo!

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:05.670
Pollun...

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:06.910
Even if you ride on that rainbow,

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:08.990
you won't be able to go 
back to the Field of Light.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:10.200
Without Stone Keeper,

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:12.720
the rainbow you need to return to 
the Field of Light won't appear.

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:15.550
I'm going home popo.

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:18.040
You really want to go home, don't you?

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:19.510
I'm going home popo.

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:23.480
I'm going back to the Field of Light popo!

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:26.790
Shall we go out to play somewhere, Pollun?

00:12:26.790 --> 00:12:27.940
Where do you want to go?

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:29.660
To the festival.

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:30.530
Festival?

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:32.590
Let's go to the festival together popo!

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:35.170
The festival is over already.

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:37.490
It's only once a year.

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:40.570
Festival popo! Festival popo!

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:42.780
"Takoyaki"!

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:46.550
Have some delicious "Akane Takoyaki."

00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:48.110
Would you like one?

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.730
I'll give you a discount.

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:59.890
I'm sorry... I didn't mean to force you...

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:02.650
I see...

00:13:04.230 --> 00:13:06.000
Don't let it bother you.

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:07.830
Akane-san!

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:09.470
Nagisa!

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:11.890
Come to think of it, you 
live around here, don't you?

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.160
Yes, it's close by.

00:13:13.530 --> 00:13:15.370
We're going to the festival.

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:17.840
Festival? Where's the festival?

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:19.640
There isn't any, but...

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:21.810
If we don't go, he won't forgive us.

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:24.370
See you again!

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:26.590
I'll give you a discount.

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:29.050
I still have snow cones, too.

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:34.680
See? There's no festival here, is there?

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:35.920
Do you understand?

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:38.300
Let's go together again next year.

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:40.460
I want to go back to the Field of Light popo.

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:41.340
All right.

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:43.630
Let's go to the festival.

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:45.410
Popo!

00:14:02.060 --> 00:14:04.810
So, Pollun... How's this for a festival?

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:06.020
Popo!

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:07.170
I have to hand it to you, Nagisa...

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:07.990
This is a great idea.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.960
It's like a festival all 
year round here, isn't it?

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:12.460
It's a festival popo!

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:13.260
Mipo!

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:14.180
Mepo!

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:15.420
Popo!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:19.090
Popo! It's so high popo!

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:20.670
He's happy mipo!

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:23.450
Pollun is simple-minded, so 
he's easy to handle mepo.

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:26.580
You look like you're 
having fun yourself mipo.

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:30.280
I always enjoy amusement parks mepo.

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:31.030
Popo.

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:32.050
Mipo.

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:36.920
I'm glad he's regained his spirit.

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:39.640
I feel terrific, too.

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:41.900
Do you remember this place?

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:43.690
I do...

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:06.640
It was quite a surprise that time, wasn't it?

00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:08.530
Don't tell me it could happen again today?

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:09.760
Stop it!

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:11.610
I'm sorry... Let's forget about that.

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:14.080
That's right. We're here today for Pollun.

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:16.420
That's right... This is for Pollun.

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:17.330
Popo?

00:15:17.590 --> 00:15:20.060
I just said that we're a team.

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:21.360
Team?

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:25.490
We're friends and like family, aren't we?

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:27.060
Friends?

